                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The capital city of India, located in the national capital territory of Delhi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c2813b0-cb26-4353-af6d-b36987dfb793",
                                                "sense_id": "40fd815d-54e5-396c-abcc-c9f32a553434",
                                                "text": "“Here is a case of the top official in Canada very publicly leveling one of the most serious allegations one could make against India, one that relates to an issue that is extremely sensitive for New Delhi,” Kugelman, of the South Asia Institute, said. “It really reinforced this anger in New Delhi that Canada simply doesn’t care about these concerns, and it’s willing to embarrass India.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf398611-6b2d-3832-a44a-514042b9c609",
                                        "entry_id": "89f3d076-dbfa-33c2-bd75-b605680c8d3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The government of India."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "metonymically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f737a091-b0ce-465f-822f-5f88f5513e08",
                                                "sense_id": "cf398611-6b2d-3832-a44a-514042b9c609",
                                                "text": "India claimed a diplomatic victory over Pakistan after Islamabad failed to win support for a U.N. resolution on Kashmir that New Delhi said violated its sovereignty. A group of countries led by Pakistan withdrew the resolution, which urged ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77f00a0b-3512-4215-bcc6-9c0098af0916",
                                                "sense_id": "cf398611-6b2d-3832-a44a-514042b9c609",
                                                "text": "As Russia accords considerable priority to its strategic partnership with India, it has to reckon with the Indian factor and is therefore subject to pressure from New Delhi in its relations with China."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaeb1566-6e11-4515-96a6-ef7eebca240d",
                                                "sense_id": "cf398611-6b2d-3832-a44a-514042b9c609",
                                                "text": "In a statement issued on 3 November, New Delhi said that it will study the recommendations on institutional changes outlined in the report of the UN Secretary General's panel that had stopped short of definitive recommendations on new permanent members."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
